{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/880060-awakening-second-edition-faq-thread","id":880060,"title":"Awakening Second Edition FAQ Thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-02T05:07:07-07:00","id":880060,"title":"Awakening Second Edition FAQ Thread","content":"(Mods, please sticky!)<br /> <br /> So, not to detract from the &quot;Ask a Simple Question&quot; threads, but I was fond of the FAQ Bill (the original Mage Developer) kept up for first edition, and I get pounced on with queries everywhere I go on the internet. So, to keep things organised...<br /> <br /> <b>Ask Dave!</b><br /> <br /> Some rules:<br /> <br /> 1) This thread is for posing rules and setting queries for Mage: The Awakening. I will collect them, and put the answers in a Google Doc linked to from the next post.<br /> <br /> 2) By posting in this thread, you agree to let me quote your question.<br /> <br /> 3) Please do not supply answers to other posters' questions, even if you think the answer's obvious.<br /> <br /> 4) Once the FAQ goes up, please check to see if your query has already been answered before. I will organize it by sections corresponding to the chapters of the 2e core, and if we're still going by the time sourcebooks come out, I'll add them too.<br /> <br /> 5) I reserve the right to stop this at any time, as I'm not paid to do it.<br /> <br /> 6) If possible, provide page references to support your question.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":22}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-02T05:07:39-07:00","id":880061,"title":"","content":"This Post Reserved for a link to the FAQ Doc, once Dave has compiled enough content for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-02T23:28:21-07:00","id":880770,"title":"","content":"So is Mystery Cult Influence just straight-up better than Mystery Cult Initiation? The whole bit about plausible deniability makes it seem like altogether better as a Merit, and I can't help but wonder if that was the intent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-03T04:11:59-07:00","id":880865,"title":"","content":"This is as FAQ as they come: Is Lost's Arcadia the same as the Acanthus Arcadia?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theo