"value":"479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-03T14:31:43-07:00","id":881268,"title":"","content":"Does the 9-Again quality of the Precise Force Utility Attainment applies to all rolls, or only Physical rolls? It's not explicated either way.<br /> <br /> Does the Mind Shield Attainment work against firearms? It doesn't explicitly says in the text.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/216-zooroos","name":"Zooroos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar216_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"250"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-03T15:19:52-07:00","id":881298,"title":"","content":"Is it in theme for a creature of Pandemonium to restrain the spaces people can move through (jamming door's lock, collapsing street ends in huge gaps) in addition to adding imaginary spaces to the world (inexistent floors, gaping botomless holes)?<br /> <br /> Or more simply is Silent Hill in theme with a Pandemonium Bound?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2225-ganonso","name":"ganonso","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2225_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-03T15:37:24-07:00","id":881312,"title":"","content":"What would it take to transform oneself into a Morphean?<br /> <br /> Are we going to see ghost mages in an upcoming book?<br /> <br /> Is the base Potency for a Fraying spell cast by a Disciple 2 or 3?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"react